evidence — cite the specific variable, field, or error code. If any API
response shows "status": "exception", a 4xx/5xx code, or an empty result
where data was expected, begin with FAILED.

NEXT: One to three sentences of approach-level guidance — which tool or app
to use, which gap to close. No code. If every stated requirement is
satisfied, write exactly: NEXT: task complete.

